          "jcr:created": "Thu Feb 06 2025 18:52:38 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h2><span class=\"futura-bold\">Overview</span></h2>\n<p>Working in collaboration with 3D Systems as the exclusive partner, VSP Reconstruction is a digital planning solution for maxillofacial surgical procedures. Common VSP Reconstruction applications include planning for maxilla/mandible reconstruction using the fibula free-flap, facial trauma and distraction osteogenesis.</p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Plan with&nbsp;</span><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">confidence</span></span></span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Jun 13 2025 23:29:50 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "rightPadding": "5",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
