          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-1f15d09fdf@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Mon Apr 14 2025 20:44:12 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Anatomical design</span></span></p>\n<p>Case is planned using patient-specific CT data. Allowing for the ability to visualize anatomical landmarks and ensure surgical plan matches patients anatomy.</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Jun 13 2025 23:23:54 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
      "col2": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "text_copy": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-1f15d09fdf@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-1f15d09fdf@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Mon Apr 14 2025 20:44:12 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Design session</span></span></p>\n<p>Web-based design session allows a surgeon direct input on every step of the pre-surgical plan.</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Jun 13 2025 23:24:12 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
      "col3": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "text_copy_414082397": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-1f15d09fdf@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-1f15d09fdf@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Mon Apr 14 2025 20:44:12 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Cutting/positioning guides</span></span></p>\n<p>Cutting and positioning guides transfer the pre-surgical plan into the operating room, helping to create increased accuracy and efficiency.</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Jun 13 2025 23:24:32 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
      "col4": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
