          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-b3eaac8b1c@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Mon Apr 14 2025 20:44:12 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Case report</span></span></p>\n<p>Case report outlines the step-by-step of the pre-surgical plan, serving as a reference in before-surgery and in the operating room.</p>\n",
